06:14.510 --> 06:16.240
Kenapa kali ini lambat sangat?

06:28.820 --> 06:29.310
Selamat pagi.

06:29.310 --> 06:30.110
Selamat pagi.

06:49.920 --> 06:51.050
Siapa yang buat ini?

06:51.430 --> 06:52.630
Zaman apa lagi
nak main gurau-gurau macam ini?

06:52.630 --> 06:53.830
Tak matang langsung.

07:07.560 --> 07:08.360
Tisu basah.

07:19.190 --> 07:20.270
Bergerak!

07:21.160 --> 07:22.510
Ya, pusing.

07:24.240 --> 07:25.040
Setiap orang bergilir,

07:25.040 --> 07:25.720
