10:25.240 --> 10:27.440
Kuang Geng, awak jangan berlagak sangat.

10:27.440 --> 10:28.360
Dengar sini,

10:29.150 --> 10:31.350
kalau awak berani buat hal begini lagi,

10:31.750 --> 10:33.610
